  "description": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "The University of Utah is a public research university in Salt Lake City, Utah, and the flagship institution of the Utah System of Higher Education. Founded in 1850, it is one of the oldest universities west of the Mississippi River and is classified as a Tier 1 research institution and a member of the prestigious Association of American Universities (AAU).",
      "The university enrolls over 38,000 students across 17 colleges and schools, offering more than 150 academic departments and programs. Top-ranked programs include Computer Science, Entertainment Arts and Engineering (Games), Nursing, the David Eccles School of Business, and the School of Medicine.",
      "The main 1,500-acre campus sits at the foot of the Wasatch Mountains, providing students with easy access to world-class skiing, hiking, and outdoor recreation. Salt Lake City — a fast-growing tech hub known as Silicon Slopes — hosts internship opportunities at Adobe, Qualtrics, and dozens of startups.",
      "International students benefit from the U of U's strong global presence, including a sister Asia Campus in Incheon, South Korea, and dedicated International Student & Scholar Services. The university has been ranked #1 State by U.S. News & World Report (2025)."
    ],
    "paragraphsRu": [
      "University of Utah — государственный исследовательский университет в Salt Lake City, штат Юта, и флагман Utah System of Higher Education. Основан в 1850 — один из старейших университетов к западу от Миссисипи, Tier 1 research, член престижной Association of American Universities (AAU).",
      "Более 38,000 студентов учатся в 17 колледжах и школах, доступно 150+ academic departments and programs. Сильнейшие направления: Computer Science, Entertainment Arts and Engineering (Games), Nursing, David Eccles School of Business, School of Medicine.",
      "Главный 1,500-акровый кампус расположен у подножия гор Wasatch — близко к горнолыжным курортам, hiking и outdoor recreation. Salt Lake City — быстро растущий tech hub, известный как Silicon Slopes; здесь головные офисы Adobe, Qualtrics и десятков startups.",
      "Международные студенты получают поддержку от International Student & Scholar Services, плюс есть зарубежный Asia Campus в Incheon, South Korea. В 2025 U.S. News & World Report присвоил штату Юта рейтинг #1 State."
    ],
